Date: Wed, 12 Nov 2025 15:02:20 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Fix JLPT test JSON format handling and implement per-question
 scoring

- Update test data loading to handle new JSON format (meta + questions structure)
- Fix forEach error by ensuring testData is always an array
- Implement per-question scoring using points_per_question field
- Update furigana pattern to handle empty parentheses like ()(reading)
- Add points-based scoring display in stats and results sections
